    m_Localized: Tap to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2667964461056
    m_Localized: "This bar represents your remaining fuel. \nIt will decrease each
      time you move"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3099042443264
    m_Localized: Tap on the red arrow to move in the selected direction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3190365024256
    m_Localized: You may change the camera's perspective tapping this button
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3293125472256
    m_Localized: 'Tap on the map to open and close it.

      The number represents
      the amount of time you may check it'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3439280189440
    m_Localized: Hover over the buildings to see what they are
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3508679143424
    m_Localized: The yellow road represents the fastest way to you destination
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3632025235456
    m_Localized: The blue arrow points to your current location. The purple arrow
      points to your desired destination
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3787541639168
    m_Localized: This is the city's map. You'll need to memorize the route to win
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 378826388598784
    m_Localized: Use less than 50% of total fuel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 378990167781376
    m_Localized: Don't check the map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 379021444706304
